{"id":"n74364-1-8","stage":5,"title":"재촉 · 催促","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74364-1-8-1","ko":"나한테 빌려간 돈 언제 갚을 거야?","zh":"你借我的钱什么时候还啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려간","meaning":"借；表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","explanation":"빌리다：借；가다：表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"28764","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려간","audio":"/audio/c7ee24ec86c6af4b5b61.mp3"}},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"갚을","meaning":"还，偿还","explanation":"갚다：还，偿还；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"갚다","audio":"/audio/71bc1db964cf7285b77b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15728","senseId":"1","lemma":"갚다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갚을","audio":"/audio/93fd7e3b309953b06b6e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"28764","definition":"表示动作、状态、状态变化的持续或进行。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"71bc1db964cf7285","term":"갚다","zh":"还，偿还","audio":"/audio/71bc1db964cf7285b77b.mp3","entryId":"15728","definition":"送回借来的东西。","pronunciation":["갑따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/20d4b3d4f48d758a2181.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74364-1-8-2","ko":"어제 빌린 건데 재촉 좀 하지마. 금방 갚을게.","zh":"昨天才借的，别催了。我马上就还。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"빌린","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌린","audio":"/audio/85701e9851b88be05440.mp3"}},{"text":"건데","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건데","audio":"/audio/035d13b9ecf5dca77fd4.mp3"}},{"text":"재촉","meaning":"催促，催迫","explanation":"재촉：催促，催迫。","readings":[{"term":"재촉","audio":"/audio/0360ab340a48002a5bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74364","senseId":"1","lemma":"재촉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재촉","audio":"/audio/0360ab340a48002a5bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"하지마.","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；不做","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思；말다：不做；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"},{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지마","audio":"/audio/60fab061d5356af206be.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"갚을게.","meaning":"还，偿还","explanation":"갚다：还，偿还；을게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"갚다","audio":"/audio/71bc1db964cf7285b77b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15728","senseId":"1","lemma":"갚다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갚을게","audio":"/audio/173b48d8196a3abd6074.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"0360ab340a48002a","term":"재촉","zh":"催促，催迫","audio":"/audio/0360ab340a48002a5bcb.mp3","entryId":"74364","definition":"反复要求加快做某事。","pronunciation":["재촉"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"71bc1db964cf7285","term":"갚다","zh":"还，偿还","audio":"/audio/71bc1db964cf7285b77b.mp3","entryId":"15728","definition":"送回借来的东西。","pronunciation":["갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b181b7c31d6aeff29092.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.425,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74364","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你借我的钱什么时候还啊？","昨天才借的，别催了。我马上就还。","咦？真奇怪，为什么电脑打不开啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你借我的钱什么时候还啊？","昨天才借的，别催了。我马上就还。","咦？真奇怪，为什么电脑打不开啊？"],"answer":1}]}
